{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act27side_level_act27side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act27side",
  "stageId": "act27side_04",
  "title": "一個水手出海了",
  "storyCode": "SL-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e0786bb55bb7fb9065234565d78f9afed6f065fd3aed0c6fdf0f29b81ebbc2c3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_village"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我說啊，那個叫安麥爾的沒尾巴也太奇怪了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃東西會吃出羽獸蛋殼，輪到她過橋的時候吊繩居然斷了，蓋房子被瀑布沖了，抓鱗反而被大鱗抓走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢，我記得依娜姆大姐說過，這叫什麼來著？美運體質？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是霉運體質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們兩個，別忘了向安麥爾道謝。沒有她，就像你們這樣工作一天快活一天，這些新房子可不知道什麼時候才能建好呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "轟隆——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳、咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼回事？門怎麼炸了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，我很快就能把它修好......我本來在烘乾合頁上的黏合劑，可能是我操作不當哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黏合劑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是我的酒壺，我奶奶給我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，東西應該都搬來了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都在這邊了，我們搬了一上午呢！今天晚上可得好好泡個澡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一上午？都是什麼貨物......咖啡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，都是汐斯塔的咖啡。我們開通了和汐斯塔的商路，這是送來的第一批貨品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看看，包裝上好像有說明文字......“把花的種子和咖啡豆一起烘焙”......汐斯塔人用這種配方來調和咖啡的苦味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我小的時候，爺爺也是這麼做咖啡喝的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安麥爾小姐的爺爺，好像是汐斯塔人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......不過我們一家人很早之前就搬到哥倫比亞了。等這個月的活幹完，我存的錢就夠搭車回汐斯塔了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？早知道我就讓汐斯塔派來的商隊帶上你了，一個多小時前他們剛走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安麥爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1015_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g8_siestavolcanomuseum_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老舊的筆記本裡，夾著一張照片。\n三個穿著登山服的人站成一排，三張笑臉被山風吹得通紅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱勒老師......也在當時的考察隊伍裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g4_siestanewstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那次考察中，凱勒本該也是考察隊的一員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是登山的前一天，凱勒突然離開隊伍，返回了威廉大學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突然離隊？是有什麼原因嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道，當年的考察筆記中完全沒有提及。只知道緊跟那場事故之後，凱勒出現在了威廉大學和萊塔尼亞政府的會議上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g8_siestavolcanomuseum_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多利先生，那個時候你在嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......還是要幫你找到東西才肯理我嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，多利先生，你聽說過火山預警花嗎？它是一種會根據火山活動改變顏色的植物，你要找的是這種花的種子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者......黑曜石？埋在土壤裡的黑色結晶，是不是也很像種子呢......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿黛爾自言自語的話，並沒有招來回應，眼前碩大的火山岩標本沉默如常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我想多了嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多利先生，你多給一點提示的話，我才能儘快找到你想要找的東西呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛爾？你在找什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒有，凱勒老師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凱勒看著阿黛爾合起筆記，放進整理箱中。\n阿黛爾低著頭，把手邊其他幾份資料拿來，蓋在父母的筆記上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛爾......你有什麼疑問，都可以直接問我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿黛爾沉默了一會兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也沒有，凱勒老師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來跟你同步一些情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根據前方檢測站傳回來的數據和黑曜石的樣本分析，得出的結論是汐斯塔火山爆發的時間可能還會提前幾天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汐斯塔火山的數據一直有些奇怪，火山內部源石礦脈能量活動在兩年前的夏天達到一個峰值後快速回落，之後又緩慢攀升。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留給我們準備的時間不多了，要加快點腳步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1014_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！火山要提前爆發了？還有這種好事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）多利先生！不要突然跳出來啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛爾，你在聽我說嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！我在聽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛爾，我知道你已經是一個經驗豐富的學者了，觀測的前期準備工作對你來說只是小事一樁。但還是請保持專注，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉！凱勒老師......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1014_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔哦......開小差被老師抓住了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，這兩天你在博物館裡，有遇到奇怪的遊客嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "發生什麼事了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "互動區放著的一塊響石樣本弄丟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "響石？是風吹過可以發出樂器聲響的石頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我們也需要和市政廳的人反應加強博物館的警備了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也會注意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不知道是不是這天氣作祟，最近有很多奇怪的事，報案說自己丟了東西的人格外多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早上聽新聞的時候，聽說未建成地塊那邊的倉庫，還被人惡意搞了破壞，現場弄得一團糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "峯馳物流員工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "經理，貨物受損已經統計過了，沒有丟什麼東西，主要是裝物資的箱子受了不少破壞。除了一些食品類商品，其他貨物倒沒有損失太多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很抱歉在汐斯塔發生了這樣的事，這是我們工作疏忽導致的，希望這不會影響您與汐斯塔合作的想法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，如果您決定停止合作的話，我也會如實匯報給赫爾曼市長的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是這樣的話，失去合作對象的赫爾曼市長和失去工作的我都會很難過就是了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "追責倒是次要的，我需要確保這樣的事情不會再次發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起來......居民們並不歡迎峯馳物流在新地塊的規劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我最近時常因為還能完整地站在您面前和您對接工作而感到慶幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我是指，讓這裡的居民接受城市改建並不算您工作的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "峯馳物流和汐斯塔將來的合作離不開這裡居民的支持，我不希望大家將這次改建視為一種單方面的逼迫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您能有這份心，我很感謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_990_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......事已至此，我希望市政廳可以更多注意一點倉庫附近的安保工作，希望這樣的意外不要再發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，我會傳達您的意見，並確保它能夠落實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我替我的工作、房貸還有焦慮的未婚妻謝謝您，拜松先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果您這邊沒有別的安排，我就要接著去努力說服商業街的人在搬遷意向書上簽字了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g3_siestanewstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "詩懷雅小姐之前到訪，沒能好好招待，十分遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知這幾天遊覽，詩懷雅小姐對新汐斯塔的印象怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很乾淨，很美觀——但總覺得少了些趣味，顯得呆板了些。實話實說，我還是更喜歡它原來的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真巧，我的女兒也說過類似的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是汐斯塔被迫離開了原來的黃金海岸線，也就注定不能延續原來以旅遊業為支柱的經濟模式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真可惜，我還挺喜歡那條“舊汐斯塔風情街”的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "市長看來是很篤定地相信與峯馳物流的合作了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也很期待詩懷雅小姐提出不一樣的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，詩懷雅小姐家族集團的名聲向來是如雷貫耳，只是沒想到，執行投資人的人選會是您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我碰巧瞭解到，您似乎剛剛在汐斯塔註冊了一家公司，經營範圍是，建築與文化娛樂......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來市長先生不太能信任我，是覺得我的話語權在這個集團中還不夠分量？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡，未來永遠在你們年輕人手中。只是偶然想起，與來自維多利亞的“集團”打交道，已經是三十餘年前的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍微熟悉汐斯塔歷史的人都會瞭解，那時汐斯塔從維多利亞膨脹的野心下逃脫，不算一件輕鬆的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而赫爾曼市長在那場糾紛中發揮的能量，至今仍為許多政客津津樂道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "市長先生倒也不用多慮，我現在的身份並不複雜。我帶來的也只有誠意的合作和更多商機而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "詩懷雅小姐有意要和峯馳物流爭奪新建地塊的開發權，我當然願意看到你們雙方的良性競爭，汐斯塔永遠歡迎有誠意的合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是很期待在競標會上您提出的方案，也祝您在汐斯塔接下來的旅程愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等您回到龍門後，請替我向您的祖父問好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餐廳老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1001_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會簽這個字的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餐廳老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1001_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已經搬過一次家了，我們還要被折騰多少次......再說了，把我們這些店面拆了，讓我們靠什麼生活......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餐廳老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1001_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是市長不能給我們一個明確的說法，我們是絕對不會考慮搬遷的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是要逼我們搬走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科斯達，你都混進市政廳了，還是只能聽那些高高在上的大人物們呼來喝去的？就不能幫我們想想辦法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算你不準備繼承你爺爺的咖啡店，可我們都還指望這條街活著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......大家都還在想辦法讓這條街生意好起來呢......想辦法幫幫忙吧，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喲，這不是市政廳的大老爺嗎？今天也是想把我們這些人從這條街統統趕走？穿上那身體面制服後就忘記自己是從哪來的了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我為你爺爺感到羞恥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我討厭我的工作......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老闆，我的冰淇淋好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "馬上就好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思耽誤了，給，您的四球冰淇淋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "順便，那邊那個被罵得垂頭喪氣的人，是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用管他，一個想把我們的家拆了的掃把星罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要的東西帶來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來的路上有沒有人注意到你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警官，很抱歉，路特和麗芙看到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......好了，過癮了嗎？把東西給我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你當警司的時候也是這麼和臥底溝通的？感覺還有點酷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個袋子裡裝的是這條商業街上每家店的大概資料，每家店裡住著多少人，大致的經營狀況，你要的店主性格我也大概寫了點上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個袋子裡裝的是峯馳物流近期做的一系列活動，好像是收購了一些汐斯塔特產，說是要賣到維多利亞和哥倫比亞去。數量還不太少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不錯嘛！峯馳物流的這部分資料你是怎麼拿到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簡單得很，應聘成為他們的運貨司機就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起來，拜松那傢伙是想用這種方式收買人心啊......也確實像他會做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假設將來這裡真的建起了一座物流中心，這裡的人們願意改變工作嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冰品店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃尼斯，來杯陳皮酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冰品店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼悶悶的？我看出來了，你小子也在煩是不是？還把招牌又重新掛上了，你們用這種方式在示威嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冰品店店主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是夠煩人，隔壁家的小夫妻原先多恩愛的一對，現在為了拆遷的事天天吵架......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的酒來啦，陳皮酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這條街上的人們並不想搬家啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大部分吧......搬家就代表著要重新規劃一次生活，我們剛剛搬到移動城市上來，很多人都還在適應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟現在連遊客也很少見到，本來生意就很難做，也有不少人失業，再搬一次，生活就更難了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "埃尼斯搖搖頭，放棄了這個話題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃尼斯，像經營你們這樣一家店，平時維護需要多少錢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個月差不多......不到五百金券？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？就這麼點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多東西我都可以去買二手的，或者自己做，加上平時水電節省一點，其實比你想的要少很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有時候也真的會好奇......像你們這種有錢人，是不是從來都沒什麼煩惱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是只要一個人足夠有錢，生活裡的一切，就都能稱心如意了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......錢能解決的是麻煩，不是問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，如果必須要搬，沒有別的選擇的話，你是什麼打算？承包下來這一片地塊後，準備在這裡建什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如先問問你吧，如果一定要改建的話，你希望這片商業街變成什麼樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是幻想嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一個巨大的水上樂園吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "建一座獨一無二的最大水上樂園，說不定還能吸引來一些遊客。那樣的話，這座酒吧可能也不用拆遷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，弟弟妹妹也一直吵著想去水上樂園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，好主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼這麼隨意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總感覺比起峯馳物流的那位小哥，你不像是真心打算來競標的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，很多和我競爭的人都有過這樣的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那後來呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們都輸給我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......噗，真厲害啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃尼斯！過來幫我給招牌上點油漆，博覽會就快要開幕了，招牌可要保持最好的樣子才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "馬上來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，上回的油漆還有剩，我前幾天還低價買了幾條燈條，要不我待會兒一起掛上去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，再有剩的油漆，把桌椅畫框也重新漆一遍，路特和麗芙不是說最近和誰學了畫畫嘛，讓他們也來一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，馬上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，埃尼斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把招牌漆成橙色吧，相信我的眼光，肯定會比現在的更吸引顧客一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g8_siestavolcanomuseum_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "科斯達忘了自己怎麼會走到這裡。\n搬到新汐斯塔後，這座造型特殊的建築不知何時就出現在了自己上下班通勤的路上，印象裡自己似乎也經手過相關的文件。\n火山博物館？人們為什麼要在寸土寸金的移動城市裡大費周章地建這樣一座博物館？火山有什麼好研究的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不！我要看大石頭！我要看岩漿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，真不知道你為什麼要來看這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火山很帥氣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼！帥氣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“在火山上可以看到很美麗的風景”，科斯達腦海裡出現這樣一句話。記憶裡似乎有誰這樣對自己解釋過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你叫得出這些火山的名字嗎？我都知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道這些幹什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我告訴你！這是坦博拉火山，這是卡特拉火山，這是默拉皮火山，這是亞......亞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“亞蘇爾火山”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！你怎麼在我背後說話，嚇我一跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我是怎麼知道的？我也不記得了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，亞蘇爾火山，我知道的！它是大地上最美的火山，山上隨處可見流淌的岩漿，就像安靜的溪流......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些都是書裡寫的，我都記得清清楚楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這裡怎麼什麼介紹都沒有......我還要給你看我說的都對呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都對！看完了嗎？這裡連介紹都沒有，走吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉為您的遊覽帶來不便，這一片展區還沒有布置完成，之後會把介紹的文字貼在這裡的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，剛才那個火山叔叔，我還沒說完呢，你再聽我講講！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "科斯達被拽住衣角，有些無奈地停下腳步，試圖說明自己需要離開。\n他回過頭，卻在玻璃展櫃的映像中看到了一張意料之外的面孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼是你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科斯達......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sunnytown_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我不希望自己只是芸芸眾生之一！♪\n我大聲呐喊出來——！這是我的人生！！♪\n啊，不好意思，我沒有注意到店裡還有客人。\n真奇怪，現在正在舉辦黑曜石音樂節，為什麼會有人待在咖啡店裡老老實實看書？你介意我在這裡練習吉他嗎？\n唉，算了，打擾客人的話又會被爺爺罵的。為了換新吉他，最近還是安分點好了。\n你在看什麼書？和火山有關的書......感覺還挺酷的，可以借我看看嗎？\n......\n你明天，還會來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
